# Kings Tidy — clang-tidy 23
#
# Excluded (style conflicts):
#   modernize-use-trailing-return-type    — conflicts with BreakAfterReturnType: All
#   misc-definitions-in-headers           — header-only codebase
#   cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-static-cast-downcast — no RTTI, dynamic_cast unavailable
#   google-readability-namespace-comments — FixNamespaceComments: false
#   llvm-namespace-comment                — same reason
#   misc-use-anonymous-namespace          — ODR violation in header-only
#   readability-identifier-length         — short Germanic names by design
#   bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters  — too noisy on templates
#   misc-no-recursion                     — recursive algorithms are valid
#   misc-anonymous-namespace-in-header    — header-only codebase
#
# Excluded (platform-specific):
#   abseil-*, altera-*, android-*, boost-*, darwin-*, fuchsia-*,
#   google-objc-*, clang-analyzer-osx.*, clang-analyzer-webkit.*,
#   llvmlibc-*, llvm-use-*, llvm-type-switch-*, objc-*, zircon-*, mpi-*, openmp-*
#
---
Checks: >-
  bugprone-argument-comment,
  bugprone-assert-side-effect,
